        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Basket Challenge is a 2-on-2 SD-style basketball game featuring charismatic characters and a gameplay system inspired by classic arcade beat ’em ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual for the series, traditional sports rules don’t apply. Players can steal the ball from opponents by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each team has a basket on three different backboards—high, medium, and low. Once a basket receives enough points, it breaks off the backboard. You can pick it up and repair it… or take it and attach it to your opponent’s board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages include unique features such as traps and boost zones, and each character comes equipped with distinct abilities, special techniques, and powerful super shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a full tournament mode where players can level up, unlock improvements, and customize their playstyle. With a wide variety of stages, items, teams, characters, and special shots, Street Basket Challenge offers a deep and chaotic arcade-style experience with plenty of replay value.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street Basket Challenge is a 2-on-2 SD-style basketball game featuring charismatic characters and a gameplay system inspired by classic arcade beat ’em ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual for the series, traditional sports rules don’t apply. Players can steal the ball from opponents by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each team has a basket on three different backboards—high, medium, and low. Once a basket receives enough points, it breaks off the backboard. You can pick it up and repair it… or take it and attach it to your opponent’s board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages include unique features such as traps and boost zones, and each character comes equipped with distinct abilities, special techniques, and powerful super shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes a full tournament mode where players can level up, unlock improvements, and customize their playstyle. With a wide variety of stages, items, teams, characters, and special shots, Street Basket Challenge offers a deep and chaotic arcade-style experience with plenty of replay value.</p>",
